Subject: [PATCH] [daveey] Add dormant monotone Board writer admission

Why: post-collection provenance requires local downgrade refusal before any certified capture build is activated. Register a connection-local revision and provide opt-in transactional guards independent of detachable sync triggers. Revision 1 grants admission support only; production never activates it or certifies original custody.

Proof: initial preopened-old-writer test was RED on missing gate; higher-minimum reactivation regression was RED, then the complete focused suite passed 19 tests with retries disabled. Full scripts/check passes. Pending exact-head CI and independent review; no migration, STRICT activation, sender protocol or seventh-test claim.
